Package: libgmime-3.0-0
Version: @DEB_GMIME_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/jstedfast/gmime
Depends: libglib2.0-0
Description: MIME parser and utility library - runtime
 GMime is a MIME message parser and utility library used by mail clients.
 This iOS build disables GpgME-backed crypto and IDN for the first Geary lane.
